text = "[center][b][font_size=44]Welcome to Reflex![/font_size][/b]
Two friends, two islands, one invisible mirror.

Every move you make, your reflection makes [b]the opposite way[/b].
A rock stops one of them, but not the other. Use that!
Get [b]both[/b] friends onto their flags at the same time.

[img=40x40]res://assets/input_prompts/Default/keyboard_arrows.png[/img] Move   [img=40x40]res://assets/input_prompts/Default/keyboard_z.png[/img] Undo   [img=40x40]res://assets/input_prompts/Default/keyboard_r.png[/img] Restart   [img=40x40]res://assets/input_prompts/Default/keyboard_escape.png[/img] Change friends

[i]Press[/i] [img=40x40]res://assets/input_prompts/Default/keyboard_enter.png[/img] [i]to start[/i][/center]"
fit_content = true
